      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Since 1845, the Atlanta–Augusta Railroad turned Lithonia into a granite‑quarrying hub, feeding the region’s building boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
